			<div class="content" id="post-content-3864621">
									

<p>A 4K entry about a war that was never fought by a Foundation that never existed.</p>
<p><strong>Page image:</strong> modified from <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Victoria_crater_from_HiRise.jpg">https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Victoria_crater_from_HiRise.jpg</a></p>
<p>Header images are my own work. Feel free to use them in your own articles - message me in #site19 (my IRC nick is &quot;cabbage&quot;) if you'd like the SVG files.</p>
<p>Thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drclef" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(213153); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=213153&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1534492342" alt="DrClef" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=213153)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drclef" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(213153); return false;">DrClef</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tat0b910" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3736652); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3736652&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1534492342" alt="Tat0b910" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3736652)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tat0b910" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3736652); return false;">Tat0b910</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/taylor-itkin" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3208919); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3208919&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1534492342" alt="taylor_itkin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3208919)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/taylor-itkin" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3208919); return false;">taylor_itkin</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/reverend-ravenclaw" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4178500); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4178500&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1534492342" alt="reverend-ravenclaw" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4178500)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/reverend-ravenclaw" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4178500); return false;">reverend-ravenclaw</a></span>, and neptune (on IRC) for crit.</p>
<p>Thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/bluedanoob" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1688804); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1688804&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1534492342" alt="Bluedanoob" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1688804)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/bluedanoob" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1688804); return false;">Bluedanoob</a></span> for idea feedback on IRC. Also, thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jacob-conwell" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1372582); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1372582&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1534492342" alt="Jacob Conwell" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1372582)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jacob-conwell" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1372582); return false;">Jacob Conwell</a></span> for clearing up a few things about AR canon, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/not-a-seagull" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3009022); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3009022&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1534492342" alt="not_a_seagull" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3009022)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/not-a-seagull" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3009022); return false;">not_a_seagull</a></span> for telling me the syntax for inserting a user link.</p>
<p>Listpages trickery borrowed from <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirpudding" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(348648); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=348648&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1534492342" alt="sirpudding" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=348648)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirpudding" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(348648); return false;">sirpudding</a></span>'s SCP-2111, who borrowed it in turn from <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/eskobar" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1173523); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1173523&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1534492342" alt="Eskobar" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1173523)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/eskobar" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1173523); return false;">Eskobar</a></span>'s SCP-2998.</p>
