<p>This is very good and I like it a lot. It builds nicely over time, there are a lot of cool hooks and reveals as it progresses and the security restriction conceit actually works very well here. I'm a little confused by the ending though - it says that U53 were the only survivors and 68 other people were killed, but the log to me implies that U53 were destroyed by the 4000-1 instances. Either that or I'm just missing something completely here.</p>
<p>I have a couple of visual nitpicks; the text in the green areas of your logs is a touch too small, which makes reading it slightly more difficult that it needs to be. And, while I do like the concept behind them, the graphical headers look a little too rough for me to really buy into them. Neither of those points are enough to stop me upvoting though, so +1.</p>
